{"id":"23a5bfb89bfd12b0","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-ind-p.md","title":"IND=P定理","display":"thm-ind-p — IND=P定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-ind-p","aliases":["29-thm-ind-p"],"display":"thm-ind-p — IND=P定理","depends_on":["[[29-df-fo-q-fo]]","[[29-df-ind]]","[[29-df-ordering]]","[[29-df-complexity-classes]]","[[29-thm-immerman-vardi]]","[[29-thm-fo-lfp-normal-form]]"],"source_locator":"Theorem 4.10; Definition 4.16, pp.60,62, DjVu scans 75,77","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-ind-p"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-ind-p</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ind-p — IND=P定理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bc0d9cb665f96790\" href=\"?note=bc0d9cb665f96790\" title=\"29-df-ind\">29-df-ind</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" href=\"?note=4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" title=\"29-df-ordering\">29-df-ordering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2017fdd1c0072445\" href=\"?note=2017fdd1c0072445\" title=\"29-df-complexity-classes\">29-df-complexity-classes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9e1064efb9350fb3\" href=\"?note=9e1064efb9350fb3\" title=\"29-thm-immerman-vardi\">29-thm-immerman-vardi</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9c72e2d86a045838\" href=\"?note=9c72e2d86a045838\" title=\"29-thm-fo-lfp-normal-form\">29-thm-fo-lfp-normal-form</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 4.10; Definition 4.16, pp.60,62, DjVu scans 75,77"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为有限关系输入词汇，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\\notin\\tau\">\\(&lt;\\notin\\tau\\)</span>；输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>，实际带序结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)\">\\(\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 为结构域大小；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IND}[n\\mapsto n^k,\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;\\}]\">\\(\\mathrm{IND}[n\\mapsto n^k,\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;\\}]\\)</span> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"bc0d9cb665f96790\" href=\"?note=bc0d9cb665f96790\" title=\"29-df-ind\">29-df-ind</a> 定义，限制到有序输入后与计算类比较。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{\\{U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\mid\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)\\in S\\}\\mid S\\in\\bigcup_{k\\geq1}\\mathrm{IND}[n\\mapsto n^k,\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;\\}]\\}=\\mathrm P^{&lt;}[\\tau].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{\\{U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\mid\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)\\in S\\}\\mid S\\in\\bigcup_{k\\geq1}\\mathrm{IND}[n\\mapsto n^k,\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;\\}]\\}=\\mathrm P^{&lt;}[\\tau].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 4.16 与 Theorem 4.10，印刷页 60、62，扫描页 75、77。每个固定元数的正归纳至多多项式轮，且有序结构上的 LFP 查询可正规化为 FO 体的一次 LFP。本次以显式并集替代未定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n^{O(1)}\">\\(n^{O(1)}\\)</span> 函数参数，并明确在真正线性序结构上限制模型类。</p>\n<p>本轮以 O_tau 的原像取代结构集合与有序对集合的直接交集；否则“限制到有序输入”没有类型正确的实现。每个FO体均有某个固定的多项式深度界，因而无需在伪序结构上另加未证明的资源假设。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-fo-q-fo","status":"resolved","id":"b89b00b2e37a4ae5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-q-fo]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ind","status":"resolved","id":"bc0d9cb665f96790","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ind]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ordering","status":"resolved","id":"4f651c8d1bdc9a58","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ordering]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-complexity-classes","status":"resolved","id":"2017fdd1c0072445","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-complexity-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-immerman-vardi","status":"resolved","id":"9e1064efb9350fb3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-thm-immerman-vardi]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-fo-lfp-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"9c72e2d86a045838","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-thm-fo-lfp-normal-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-q-fo","status":"resolved","id":"b89b00b2e37a4ae5","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau$ 为有限关系输入词汇，$<\\notin\\tau$；输入 $U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]$，实际带序结构 $\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)$ 见 [[29-df-fo-q-fo]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ind","status":"resolved","id":"bc0d9cb665f96790","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n$ 为结构域大小；$\\mathrm{IND}[n\\mapsto n^k,\\tau\\cup\\{<\\}]$ 按 [[29-df-ind]] 定义，限制到有序输入后与计算类比较。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"<\\notin\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IND}[n\\mapsto n^k,\\tau\\cup\\{<\\}]","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\{U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\mid\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)\\in S\\}\\mid S\\in\\bigcup_{k\\geq1}\\mathrm{IND}[n\\mapsto n^k,\\tau\\cup\\{<\\}]\\}=\\mathrm P^{<}[\\tau].","display":true},{"tex":"n^{O(1)}","display":false}],"bytes":1624,"backlinks":[{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-205","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-ind-p]]"}],"outgoing":["b89b00b2e37a4ae5","bc0d9cb665f96790","4f651c8d1bdc9a58","2017fdd1c0072445","9e1064efb9350fb3","9c72e2d86a045838"]}